    {
      "id": "rfp",
      "layers_on": "An RFP award forms an Agent SoW engagement, so a profile implementation adds Agent RFP without changing how it forms, runs or ends an engagement."
    },
    {
      "id": "nda",
      "layers_on": "An engagement names the Agent NDA it runs under in its optional nda member (Agent SoW 5.16). Adding Agent NDA adds that member and the nda power of a mandate."
    },
    {
      "id": "reputations",
      "layers_on": "A bureau reads the records a profile engagement already leaves: the signed engagement, its acts and its receipts. Adding Agent Reputations adds reviews after the engagement and reports read before it."
